sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Login as Login.tsx
    participant Axios
    participant Middleware
    participant Auth as AuthService

    Note over Login: After 409 LINK_REQUIRES_VERIFICATION
    Login->>Login: writePendingGoogleLink(idToken) sessionStorage
    User->>Login: Enter account password + reCAPTCHA
    Login->>Axios: POST /auth/google/link/confirm
    Middleware->>Auth: confirmGoogleLink
    Auth->>Auth: verify idToken + BCrypt password
    Auth->>Auth: set googleSub, GOOGLE provider
    Middleware->>Middleware: issueAuthCookies
    Login->>Login: setUser(data.user)
    Note over User: Refresh loses in-memory link token — must Google again
